{"seq":3,"slug":"security","title":"安全与风控篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"defi-attack-vectors","title":"DeFi 攻击向量与防御模式","url":"/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/security/defi-attack-vectors","wordCount":1343,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"oracle-and-price-manipulation","title":"预言机安全设计与价格操纵防御","url":"/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/security/oracle-and-price-manipulation","wordCount":1365,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"protocol-risk-management","title":"协议风险管理框架","url":"/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/security/protocol-risk-management","wordCount":1328,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 安全与风控篇导读\n\nDeFi 协议在「开放组合性」与「安全性」之间存在根本张力。本章从协议设计者的视角审视安全问题：不是如何做审计（那属于「智能合约安全」hub），而是如何在架构层面预防攻击、如何设计健壮的预言机集成方案、以及如何建立协议级的风险管理框架。三篇文档覆盖攻击向量分析、预言机安全设计、以及包含保险基金和渐进式清算的风控体系。\n"}